    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dash and slide your way around a strange world as a little robot, sent to collect samples to stop the spread of an All-Consuming Entity. It will be coming for you, and only your quick platforming skills will help you escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 90s-era platforming: Test your skills in a 1-hit-death-quick-respawn platforming adventure in which you must explore, collect... and escape </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More levels than you can ever play: Control a procedural generator with both simple and advanced modes. Then share the seeds with your friends and see who does it better!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dash and slide your way around a strange world as a little robot, sent to collect samples to stop the spread of an All-Consuming Entity. It will be coming for you, and only your quick platforming skills will help you escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 90s-era platforming: Test your skills in a 1-hit-death-quick-respawn platforming adventure in which you must explore, collect... and escape </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More levels than you can ever play: Control a procedural generator with both simple and advanced modes. Then share the seeds with your friends and see who does it better!</p></li></ul>",
